      "sourceTextSha256": "ccd7318d6c3f2cdff640916948dcc246b19ca7f227e85b282c1d923498de5ff1",
      "text": "This 10-day journey takes you through Rio de Janeiro, Iguazu Falls and Buenos Aires. In Rio, you will see the city from Sugarloaf Mountain and Corcovado, with the option to add a helicopter flight, a boat trip, culinary workshops and an evening show. The route then explores both sides of Iguazu Falls. The final days focus on Buenos Aires, tango, Argentine cuisine and optional trips to the pampas or Montevideo.",
